@startuml st-payment-transaction
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title State Machine Diagram — PaymentTransaction Entity (5 States)

[*] --> PENDING : Payment checkout order created (VNPay)\n[Drafting reservation, renewal, overdue, or extra fee]\n/ PaymentService#createCheckoutLink (BR-PAY-01)

PENDING --> SUCCESS : VNPay return / callback validated\n[Transaction status 00 & amount matching]\n/ PaymentService#completeVnpayPayment (BR-PAY-02)
PENDING --> FAILED : Payment gateway reports processing error / invalid transaction\n/ PaymentService#handleFailedWebhook
PENDING --> EXPIRED : Payment window expires (48h for deposit, 15m for dynamic QR)\n/ PaymentExpiryScheduler (BR-PAY-03)

SUCCESS --> PENDING_REFUND : Return settlement or early cancellation entitles refund\n[Refund calculation approved by FM]\n/ SettlementService#initiateRefund (BR-RET-08, BR-CAN-02)

PENDING_REFUND --> SUCCESS : Bank refund transfer executed successfully\n[Ledger transaction marked complete]\n/ RefundService#confirmRefundCompleted

FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
SUCCESS --> [*]
@enduml

